{"id":892944,"title":"直播加餐｜如何使用 MCP & A2A 实现多智能体股票助手","content":"<p><video poster=\"https://media001.geekbang.org/3075a4b962de71f0bfc24531948c0102/snapshots/2c1304d4e07f4138a484fd940b84eb77-00005.jpg\" preload=\"none\" controls=\"\"><source src=\"https://media001.geekbang.org/customerTrans/7e27d07d27d407ebcc195a0e78395f55/2c050d44-1981742eb8c-0000-0000-01d-dbacd.mp4\" type=\"video/mp4\"><source src=\" https://media001.geekbang.org/90ab6bee62e271f0aa435420848d0402/4570e8b530f14e1b900338ef1b80f4eb-8696ab6613ddd9909a36d522d468f03d-sd.m3u8\" type=\"application/x-mpegURL\"></video></p><p>想知道如何借助 MCP 与 A2A 打造多智能体股票助手吗？</p><p>在 1 小时的直播时间里，我们将直击智能体开发实战。你会了解到智能体工具开发套路的演变历程，探寻 MCP 的本质以及 A2A 协议的本质。更重要的是，我们会深入讲解基于 A2A 的多智能体股票助手实现方式。</p><p>无论你是对智能体开发感兴趣的新手，还是有一定经验想进一步提升的开发者，这场直播都能为你提供实用的知识和技巧，助力你在智能体开发的道路上更进一步。</p><p>你将获得⬇️</p><p>1.智能体工具开发套路的演变<br>\n2.探讨MCP的本质<br>\n3.探讨A2A协议的本质<br>\n4.基于A2A的多智能体股票助手实现</p><!-- [[[read_end]]] -->","comments":[{"had_liked":false,"id":402654,"user_name":"Geek_56858c","can_delete":false,"product_type":"c1","uid":4340007,"ip_address":"上海","ucode":"8645A4F697B3E4","user_header":"https://static001.geekbang.org/account/avatar/00/42/39/27/a9d4842a.jpg","comment_is_top":false,"comment_ctime":1758894337,"is_pvip":false,"replies":[{"id":146371,"content":"https:&#47;&#47;github.com&#47;xingyunyang01&#47;Geek02&#47;tree&#47;main&#47;LangGraph-a2a","user_name":"作者回复","user_name_real":"编辑","uid":1943646,"ctime":1759200861,"ip_address":"山东","comment_id":402654,"utype":1}],"discussion_count":1,"race_medal":0,"score":2,"product_id":100995901,"comment_content":"求老师A2A多智能体股票助手的github链接","like_count":0,"discussions":[{"author":{"id":1943646,"avatar":"https://static001.geekbang.org/account/avatar/00/1d/a8/5e/791d0f5e.jpg","nickname":"最后的风之子","note":"","ucode":"45D5487480A5D2","race_medal":0,"user_type":2,"is_pvip":false},"reply_author":{"id":0,"avatar":"","nickname":"","note":"","ucode":"","race_medal":0,"user_type":1,"is_pvip":false},"discussion":{"id":672201,"discuss